~
0 0 bdvL cnG 3
1 0 0 15 -1 -1
D
   He wears a tight, white imama -- a basic turban -- over an undercap. A band
of cloth covers his left eye; he shields the right eye with a hand as he
watches the meteors in the sky. His loose, ankle-length thobe is a rich blue
color that almost glows against the red light of the crater. Over one shoulder,
he carries a heft blue-black eventide hammer, always ready to swing.
~
