   She swings her hammer at the anvil over and over, in rapid succession,
occasionally swapping the metal piece for one of the ones in the wall of fire
around the edge of the rock. She wears a simple turquoise kimono belted by a
plum-red obi. Her hair is bound up around her head to keep it off of her work.
She takes little notice of you as she toils.
~
